Remove Nvidia entries from the Linux graphics blocklist

Drops the blocklist entries that prevent hardware video decoding,
DMABUF, EGL and threadsafe GL from being used on the Nvidia proprietary
driver, plus the unconditional WEBRENDER_COMPOSITOR block.

Rebased on Firefox 154.0.1: WEBRENDER_COMPOSITOR moved out of its own
section and is now appended together with FEATURE_VIDEO_HDR inside the
`if (!hdrEnabled)` branch.
